# Everything runs on Linux (host cron or Docker): always check out text files with LF,
# even on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, so shell scripts and SQL copied into the image work.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
bin/blissey text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
